          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000014\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":9,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The repair proceeds clearly to a satisfying image of the kite dancing, though the terse, repetitive sentences offer little development.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000028\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The kite’s brief fall adds a small complication before the clear repair and joyful flight; the narration remains repetitive and bare.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000058\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":9,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Sam repairs and flies the kite in a clear sequence ending with a concrete image, but the simple event-by-event prose has little texture.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000023\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":9,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Nora’s repair leads neatly to the kite dancing in the sky, though the outcome is predictable and the sentences are repetitive.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000036\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":9,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The repair and successful launch form a complete, understandable arc, but the brief prose gives little sense of character or change.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000017\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The kite’s fall provides a minor obstacle before Ben repairs it and sees it fly; the ending is concrete but the telling is very plain.\",\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":1,\"ending\":1,\"language\":1,\"overall\":1},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All six stories share the same problem and resolution: a child repairs a torn kite with tape and launches it successfully. The kite’s fall in s000028 and s000017 is only a minor variation; changed names and parent labels do not create distinct plots. These sampled stories alone do not establish the diversity of the full generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"A child uses tape to repair a torn kite, then launches it and sees it fly successfully.\"}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
